print(message) #Now in this case the program ran fine since we were using double quotes, but what happens if we use single quotes?

message = 'One of Python's strengths is its diverse community.'
print(message)

#Here we are faced with an error, and python is telling us that there is an undetermined string literal and therefore we have a syntax error.
